  /about acerca-de | /account cuenta | /join unirse | /legal-notice aviso-legal | /privacy privacidad | /terms condiciones | /progress progreso
  /my-mistakes mis-errores | /start empezar | /lesson leccion | /survey encuesta | /syllabus programa | /mascots mascotas | /game juego | /card-set juego-de-tarjetas
  /exam-plan plan-de-examen | /reading-writing lectura-y-escritura | /speaking-b1-b2 expresion-oral-b1-b2 | /object-pronouns pronombres-de-objeto
  /prepositions preposiciones | /reference referencia | /tongue-twisters trabalenguas | /siele/levels siele/niveles | /ccse/facts datos, /test prueba
  kept: dele, siele, ccse, dele-a2, extranjeria, villabruno, impostor, quaki (name), bingo, domino, tandem, quiz-chapters.
  Data-driven slugs (src/lib/routes.js, values only; keys/ids untouched): TOPIC_SLUGS (~100: noun-gender -> genero-de-los-sustantivos,
  present-perfect -> preterito-perfecto ...; ones already Spanish kept: por-para, gustar, desde-hace ...), REF_SLUGS, SHEET_SLUGS,
  ITEM_SLUGS (listening/reading/writing/speaking/culture/insider/phrases/work sectors, ~135 items), WORK_GROUP_SLUGS, BUSINESS_SLUGS.
  Fragments: /habilidades#comprension-auditiva|comprension-lectora|expresion-escrita|expresion-oral (old #hoeren/#lesen/#schreiben/#sprechen still
  work: alias map in habilidades.astro; tab ids and sessionStorage key da-fertigkeiten-tab unchanged), #niveau-x -> #nivel-x, #gruppe-<id> -> #grupo-<id>,
  #bestenliste -> #clasificacion, #offiziell -> #oficial.

REDIRECTS: src/data/legacy-redirects.json = 1683 old -> new addresses (generated once from the previous dist, which listed all 1715 old pages incl. the
  /de /fr /it /pt entry copies and the old /grammar/<topic> stubs). astro.config.mjs reads it (legacyRedirects()) next to grammarTopicRedirects(), which
  now yields /gramatica/<topic> -> /<topic>. Astro writes meta-refresh stubs under /espanol/. NEW src/integrations/legacy-redirects.mjs writes dist/_redirects
  with real 301s (same idea as lane B): 1506 static + 6 dynamic rules (identical-last-segment groups of >=20, e.g. /vocabulary/:p -> /vocabulario/:p, collapse
  into one rule so the 2000-static limit holds). NEW scripts/cf-hoist-headers.mjs + package.json `cf:prepare` moves _headers and _redirects from
  cf-dist/espanol/ to the cf-dist root (Workers static assets only read them there; this also fixes the existing _headers, which was nested and ignored).
  Hub: /spanish/* -> /espanol/:splat (hub _redirects) then the app redirect = two hops, fine.

FILES TOUCHED: 145 page files git-mv'd in src/pages; ~470 files rewritten (src, public/i18n/*.json, tests, scripts, data JSON, integrations, config).
  Hand edits: src/lib/routes.js, versuche.js (first-segment switch), deckSwap.js, mascotHelp.js, liveQuizNav.js, arbeitsblatt/client.js, LanguageOffer.astro,
  habilidades.astro, entry-pages.json (slugs of the /de /fr /it /pt copies), astro.config.mjs, scripts/check-links.mjs (+legacy file skipped),
  check-i18n-luecken.mjs + i18n-luecken-baseline.json, build-suche-seiten.mjs, check-einfach-pfad.mjs, package.json.
  Other lanes' uncommitted edits in the same files (i18n json, grammarRun.js, track.js, grammar/ruta.astro, prueba-de-nivel.astro) were kept as they were.

VERIFICATION: pnpm build ok (prebuild checks incl. check-links 1731 links / 154 routes; 1603 pages), pnpm check:base ok (3496 files), pnpm test:unterricht 56/56.
  Node check against dist: all 1715 pages of the old build still exist (page or stub); all 1683 stubs point at an existing page under /espanol/.
  git grep for old section routes in src/scripts/tests/public: clean.

LEFTOVERS / NOTES
  - Left English on purpose (internal endpoints): *.json endpoints (suche.json, klassen-katalog.json, lernset-woerter.json, fehler-regeln.json, profesores/tarjetas/lexikon/[level].json,
    profesores/quiz-chapters, profesores/pruebas/fertigkeiten|fragen.json, juegos/*/woerter-[level].json, gloss-[lang].json, vocabulario/glosses/[lang].json) and /design-system.
  - Still not Spanish because they are data ids: vocab decks a1-teil-NN (German "Teil" from the source lessons), partner sheets pa-a1-*, ga-a1-*, /juego/hochstapler,
    quiz chapter ids (g-...), "lexikon", "glosses", "woerter-".
  - Fragments left German (data/tab ids, not linked from elsewhere or keyed by data ids): /entonacion#hoeren|quiz|akzent|labyrinth|regel, /nacionalidad/dele-a2/practica#uebungssatz-2|l5|schreiben,
    /conocimientos#grammatik-start|grammatik-a1|wortschatz-b1 (download ids), dele/siele task ids (#reading-1, #writing-1 ...), #gruppe-<id> tail (unregelmaessig).
  - Analytics: spiele/common.js sends tool "game_<last path segment>", so game names change (game_listening-safari -> game_safari-auditivo); worksheet tool names were kept English on purpose.
  - Saved "recents" in localStorage hold old paths; they still work through the redirects.
  - docs/, README.md, ARCHITECTURE.md and comments still mention old routes (docs not rewritten); stale file paths remain in a few `_note` fields.
  - llms.txt is over 10 KB (build warning, longer slugs): trim SECTIONS in src/integrations/llms-txt.mjs.
  - German UI text noticed (not touched): habilidades LEAD strings, many data-i18n fallbacks (hub.werkstatt, nsw.*, lesen.hero.*, lq.host.title), aviso-legal/condiciones bodies, "Wortschatz-Karten" etc. in LearnShell.
  - Do NOT run two `pnpm build` of one app at once (dist/.prerender is shared; it crashes with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND / ENOENT).

